## CI

E2E tests run in GitHub Actions after unit tests (Chromium only).
Artifacts: HTML report + screenshots on failure + video on failure.

## For AI Agent

When adding a new feature:
1. Create `e2e/<feature>.spec.ts`
2. Use fixtures from `./fixtures`
3. Test user journeys, not implementation details
4. Locators: `getByRole` > `getByText` > `getByTestId`
5. Assertions: `toBeVisible`, `toHaveURL`, `toHaveText`
